        "\n",
        "Many columns are categorical strings (like school, sex, internet access). Even when the dataset looks clean, it's important to strip whitespaces and normalize case arrangements so we I don't get “silent duplicates” like \"yes\", \" Yes\", \"YES\", counted as different categories.\n"
