      "source": [
        "Here, if a student's final grade is 10 or higher, they pass (1). If not, they fail (0)."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "YHTJJxgAL63R"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**Wrangling VI - Creating Predictors X & target y**\n",
        "\n",
        "Now, after defining a target model, I realized that I needed to seperate the,\n",
        "\n",
        "* Predictor (X), which would be information that the model is allowed to use, from\n",
        "* target (y), which is the outcome that I want to predict\n",
        "\n",
        "X would only contain explanatory variables like study time, absences, family support, etc, while y would contain the binary variable created earlier."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "xppA2RiIwWuu"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# Define predictors and target\n",
        "X = students.drop(columns=[\"G1\", \"G2\", \"G3\", \"Passed Final Grade\"])\n",
        "y = students[\"Passed Final Grade\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "X.shape, y.shape"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "0nroWGM2wD3s",
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
