      "source": [
        "**Conclusion**: Most students fall into Weekly Study Time levels 1 and 2, regardless of outcome. At every study-time level, there are both students who pass and students who fail. However, as study time increases (from 1 to 4), the proportion of students who pass increases and the number of failures becomes relatively smaller.\n",
        "\n",
        "This highlights a trend that *students who report higher weekly study time are more likely to pass the final grade*."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "aMmGbKdQR5Ie"
      }
    },
