        "**Plot IV: Family Support versus Passed Grade**\n",
        "\n",
        "**Variables Used & Why**:\n",
        "* Family Support: Family support is a classic socio-educational factor often associated with student success. It captures encouragement, supervision, and academic help outside school.\n",
        "* Passed Final Grade: To measure against. This is binary (pass, 1 or fail, 0).\n",
        "\n",
        "Unlike earlier EDA plots (which focused on numerical predictors), this visualization examines a categorical predictor instead.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Question Asked**: Is there an association between family support and academic performance? How severe, if so?\n",
        "\n",
        "**Chart Type**: Used a bar chart because it's appropriate for comparing relationships between two categorical variables."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "tbfAqvkApr2H"
      }
    },
