        "# IV(B) Basic Predictive Model\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "**Overview**\n",
        "\n",
        "The goal of this section is to build a baseline predictive model that attempts to predict whether a student passes the final grade, using a small, interpretable set of features. This model serves as a reference point for an updated model that I ran further in the project.\n",
